'''Hylands and Harrow Lodge''' is an electoral ward in the [[London Borough of Havering]]. The ward was first used in the [[2022 London local elections|2022 elections]]. It returns three councillors to [[Havering London Borough Council]].

The ward is made up of the entirety of the previous ward of [[Hylands (ward)|Hylands]] with a few streets taken from the wards of [[Brooklands (Havering ward)|Brooklands]] and [[Romford Town (ward)|Romford Town]] in the Roneo Corner area.

It is named for [[Harrow Lodge Park]] and [[Hylands Park (London)|Hylands Park]].

